abstract: "A local-first desktop interface for locally managed language models and repository-grounded exploration of scientific dynamical-model repositories. Ask the Model v0.7.1 fixes transcript-embedded chart sizing and chart-only prose that previously reproduced partial retrieval excerpts. It preserves the explicitly qualified GISTEMP v1 and Energy Institute TES v2 paths, source provenance through History, and the established grounded-turn durability and fail-closed persistence boundaries."
keywords:
  - local AI
  - local-first
  - large language models
  - Ollama
